@startuml prophet_table_tool_overview
title Prophet Table Change Tool — All Diagrams Index
skinparam shadowing false

note as N1
  **PlantUML diagram set**
  ----
  01_packages.puml
    Package / component overview
  02_classes.puml
    Class model (dataclasses + modules)
  03_sequence_stage1.puml
    Stage 1 generate_change_log
  04_sequence_stage2.puml
    Stage 2 integrate_changes
  05_activity_safety_gates.puml
    Stage 2 validation / safety gates
